   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING • +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>\n\tConsider the root locus plot shown in figure and the statements given below:</p>\n<p>\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"media/95/95a0a4c56409f3eae977.png\" /></p>\n<p>\n\t(i) Adding a zero between <em>s</em> = –1 and <em>s</em> = –2 would move the root locus to left.<br />\n\t(ii) Adding a pole at <em>s</em> = 0 would move the root locus to the right.<br />\n\tChoose the correct option.</p>",
   "options": [
