   "marks": {
    "pos": 1,
    "neg": 0.33
   },
   "solution": "<p>\n\t(d)<br />\n\t&bull; Adding a zero to the forward path transfer function tends to push root locus to the left.<br />\n\t&bull; Adding a pole to the forward path transfer function tends to push root locus to the right.</p>"
